title: "BioRaman — Raman Hyperspectral Map Analysis for Biophysics"
abstract: >-
  A desktop GUI for exploring and analysing Raman hyperspectral maps,
  with baseline correction, peak fitting, spectral unmixing (MCR-ALS,
  N-FINDR), clustering, and 3D confocal volume rendering.
type: software
